Lower Lockside
Lower Lockside. The bottom gates of the lock face the lower pound. The towpath runs north up beside the chamber.
The lock chamber holds water at 0 feet.
The narrowboat is tied up in the lower pound.
The bottom gates stand shut.
You can also see a bottom paddle and a windlass here.
